---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="General information disclaimer for We Buy Businesses. Content on this site is not tax, legal or financial advice."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Disclaimer</p>
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="updated">Draft — last updated 5 November 2026</p>

      <p>
        The content on this website, including articles, guides, and the valuation calculator and sale readiness
        checklist, is provided for general information purposes only. It does not take into account your personal
        circumstances, financial situation or needs, and should not be relied upon as a substitute for professional
        advice.
      </p>

      <h2>Not tax, legal or financial advice</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing on this website constitutes tax, legal, financial or investment advice. Before making any decisions
        about selling your business, restructuring, or any related tax or legal matter, you should seek advice from
        a registered tax agent, lawyer, financial adviser or other appropriately qualified professional who
        understands your specific circumstances.
      </p>

      <h2>Valuation calculator</h2>
      <p>
        Our valuation calculator provides a general, indicative estimate only, based on the figures you enter. It
        is not a formal valuation and should not be relied upon as an accurate reflection of what your business
        would sell for. Actual outcomes depend on many factors, including market conditions, buyer interest, and
        matters specific to your business, which a general calculator cannot account for.
      </p>

      <h2>Sale readiness checklist</h2>
      <p>
        The sale readiness checklist is a general self-assessment tool intended to prompt useful thinking and
        conversations. It is not exhaustive, and completing it does not guarantee your business is ready for sale
        or will achieve any particular outcome.
      </p>

      <h2>No guarantee of outcome</h2>
      <p>
        Submitting your business to us does not guarantee that we will make an offer, nor does it guarantee any
        particular outcome, price or timeframe. Our review process and response, including our commitment to
        respond within one week, reflect our general practice but are not a contractual guarantee.
      </p>

      <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
      <p>
        While we aim to keep the content on this website accurate and up to date, laws, rates, thresholds and
        market conditions change over time, and we do not warrant that all information is current or complete.
        Always confirm specific details with an appropriately qualified professional before acting.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the extent permitted by law, we accept no liability for any loss or damage arising from reliance on the
        content of this website, including the valuation calculator and sale readiness checklist.
      </p>

      <p class="draft-note">
        This is a draft disclaimer provided as a starting point and has not yet been reviewed by a lawyer. Please
        review and have it checked before publishing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .container--narrow {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .draft-note {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
